  "title": "NB Bancorp, Inc. Reports Second Quarter 2026 Financial Results, Declares Quarterly Cash Dividend",
  "summary": "NB Bancorp, Inc. (the \"Company\") (Nasdaq Capital Market: NBBK ), the holding company of Needham Bank (the \"Bank\"), today announced its second quarter 2026 financial results. Net income for the second quarter of 2026 amounted to $21.1 million, or $0.53 per diluted common share, compared to net income of $15.0 million, or $0.36 per diluted common share, for the prior quarter. Return on average assets and return on average equity for the second quarter of 2026 were 1.17% and 10.03%, respectively, i",
